"view.researchprojectsscreen.help"                     = "For each research you need to create a project. You do this with the 'New project' button. You can search for an existing project with the 'Search project' button, and get an overview of all projects with the 'All projects' button.\n\nAfter creating a new project, or retrieving an existing one, you get the opportunity to read in research data and analyse it according to the criteria of the project.";

