"view.researchprojectinputscreen.help"                 = "Enter the name of the project; this name must not already be in use by an existing project. You can also add a description, but this is not required.\n\nEnigma supports nine types of research. Make your choice from the drop-down list under 'Inquiry type'.\n\nEnigma always creates a control group. Especially with smaller datasets it can be wise to use a multiplier for the control group. If your multiplier is 10 and your dataset contains 2030 items, you get a control group of 20300 items. You can set a multiplier of up to 1000, but for large data files this is not necessary and it will take a very long time to calculate all the horoscopes in the control group.\n\nUnder 'Project folder' you choose a folder in which to save the results. Enigma creates a subfolder with the name of your project inside that folder.\n\nOnce you have filled in everything, the 'Next' button appears, which opens a screen where you can enter detailed information about your project.";

