"view.researchprojectconfigscreen.help"                = "In this screen you can enter detailed information about your project. The content depends on the type of research. It may involve orbs, the house system, or the midpoint dial to use.\n\nIn all cases you can choose the factors to include in your research. Enigma already selects the choices you have recorded in the current configuration, but many of these choices can be adjusted.\n\nIf you want to adjust an orb, check the 'Override with fixed orb' checkbox; you will then get an input field for the orb(s).\n\nClick the 'Save' button to store the project in the database and optionally run the research.";
